    "body": "STOPPED: the required project-version protection overlaps PR #2026.\n\nThe pin explicit_non_rtcp_trunnion_does_not_promise_controller_compensation fails on unchanged product code.\nThe mirror reports machine.rtcp as true when controller.rtcp is false.\n\nMachineDto saves the parsed Machine in the project file.\nOlder Machine readers ignore unknown fields.\nThey would discard controller_rtcp and infer RTCP from tilt again.\nThe fix therefore needs a project-version increase to make older readers refuse these projects.\n\nPR #2026 changes PROJECT_VERSION in crates/app/src/project/file.rs from 61 to 62.\nThat PR is already stacked on #2001.\nThe worker instructions prohibit stacking on a PR that is itself stacked.\nThe current branch starts from #2001, but it cannot resolve the additional overlap under that rule.\n\nNo product code changed. No commit or push was made.\nThe local pin is in .claude/worktrees/issue-1962/crates/post/tests/trunnion_schema.rs on issue/1962-trunnion-schema.\nIts failure output is in /tmp/1962-red.log on this worker.\nThe initial overlap check also found #2020 and #2029 with inherited #2001 changes, and #1753 in a different documentation section.\n\nClaim released. The claimed label and assignment are removed.\n",
